<?jelly escape-by-default='true'?>
<div>
    Stores archived build artifacts and stashes in an OCI registry using
    <a href="https://oras.land/">ORAS</a>.
    <p>
        Each Jenkins job is mapped to an OCI repository (its full name, sanitized), and each build's
        artifacts are anchored by a small "root" artifact tagged with the build number. Every
        archived file is pushed as its own single-layer artifact that refers back to the build's
        root artifact using the OCI 1.1 referrers mechanism, so the set of files archived for a
        build can be discovered with a single referrers API call.
    </p>
</div>

